    "teach_2": {
      "id": "teach_2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Exponent products can telescope.\n\nConsider:\n(x^a/x^b)^(a+b) · (x^b/x^c)^(b+c) · (x^c/x^a)^(c+a).",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_2_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_2_step": {
      "id": "teach_2_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The total exponent of x is:\n(a−b)(a+b)+(b−c)(b+c)+(c−a)(c+a)\n=(a^2−b^2)+(b^2−c^2)+(c^2−a^2)=0.\n\nSo the product is x^0=1.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_2": {
      "id": "q_2",
      "type": "CHOICE",
      "content": {
        "text": "For non-zero x, the cyclic product (x^p/x^q)^(p+q)(x^q/x^r)^(q+r)(x^r/x^p)^(r+p) equals:",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "input": {
        "type": "CHOICE",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "label": "0"
          },
          {
            "id": "b",
            "label": "1"
          },
          {
            "id": "c",
            "label": "x"
          },
          {
            "id": "d",
            "label": "x^(p+q+r)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "questionReference": {
        "mode": "INLINE",
        "inlineData": {
          "questionType": "PRACTICE",
          "prompt": "For non-zero x, the cyclic product (x^p/x^q)^(p+q)(x^q/x^r)^(q+r)(x^r/x^p)^(r+p) equals:",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": "0"
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": "1"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": "x"
